# Pairs with TypeOK. A model-domain defect: an arriving binding names a group
# outside the binding domain.
MODULE: ArrivalCarriesAnUnboundGroup
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an arriving role binding names a group outside BindGroups
PERTURBS: ArriveBinding

--- FIND
    /\ bindings' = bindings \cup {g}
--- REPLACE
    /\ bindings' = bindings \cup {g, "t/C/g"}
--- END